    <informations>Shelly 1L Gen4 — mounting view.
Terminals, left to right as printed: S2 L O S1 Sx.

Official sources:
https://kb.shelly.cloud/knowledge-base/shelly-1l-gen4
https://kb.shelly.cloud/__attachments/a_4c1c2be3c4ec6842ba527b2e1d3b6833577db85296670250e0dd17e5550e27a9/Shelly-1L-Gen4.jpg?cb=e2e845e8fb84f10ef26aaf3aa87fb6d7
https://kb.shelly.cloud/__attachments/a_aa0cf42982e5309787878fcbeba0e4e86fb823f5f513a423b955d2dd5a030e11/1L-Gen3-internal-schematics.png?cb=85d9287e3800c57b7adaf44429d59172
https://kb.shelly.cloud/__attachments/a_b07e729d125d0d5e8990f4e29843a17a509b731d92516906285b3fad663c64f1/Shelly%201L%20Gen4%20multilingual%20printed%20user%20and%20safety%20guide.pdf

Notes:
- No neutral screw. Housing H41.2×W42.2×D16mm differs fromGen3.

Nominal dimensions and an illustrative outline: corner radii, screw pitch and recesses are drawn to be recognisable, not to manufacturing CAD.</informations>
